:: Street killer - not found [Place bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">STREETS</h1>
<br />
<center>
    <<image 'places/underground/street_killer_dead_end.jpg'>>
</center>
<br /><br />
Every lead went cold. Either nobody saw anything, or whoever did wasn't talking — and down here, not talking was just good sense.
<br /><br />
You circled the same blocks until your legs ached and the light shifted to early dusk. Nothing. Not a face, not a name.
<br /><br />
<<=($game.streetsKilledNpc?.name ?? 'She')>> was gone. Whoever took her wasn't going to answer for it tonight.
<br /><br />
<<link 'Head home'>>
    <<unset $game.streetsKilledNpc>>
    <<goto 'Underground city'>>
<</link>>
